    "reviews": "\u201cUmurangi Generation is the best work of M\u0101ori science-fiction to emerge from our fresh decade.\u201d<br>Spinoff<br><br>\u201cFor a game that's ostensibly about photography, Umurangi Generation achieves so much more.\u201d<br>9 \u2013 Gamespot<br><br>\u201cUmurangi Generation is an expression of culture that adheres to zero stereotypes, and this is evident by having never played a game like this before.\u201d<br>9.5 \u2013 Digital Chumps<br>",
